Design direction 09 FOREST SILKS complete.

**What was produced**
- `design-concepts/09-forest-silks/DESIGN.md` - full spec: dark-first deep forest green surfaces (#14271C floor, #1B3323 silk), bone text (#EBE7D8), single amber lamplight accent (#E0A33C) rationed to exactly one interactive truth per view. Full light+dark palette (oklch + hex), typography reusing Tajawal + existing Uthmanic, RTL chat-shell wireframe, component inventory (bark-grain callouts with 2px amber top edge, carved-artifact ayah strips), calm motion spec, one soft corner-radius system, and 3 signature details: the lamp rule, wood-grain hairlines, the carved artifact.
- `design-concepts/09-forest-silks/hero.svg` - landscape 1600x900 SVG mockup of the chat UI in this style (dark forest, RTL sidebar on the right, amber active marker, ayah/hadith callouts, amber send button).

**Validation**: em-dash audit passed (only reference match is the ban description); files untracked, not staged; all ground rules checked off in spec section 10.

**Note**: image_gen isn't in the subagent toolset, so the hero is a rendered SVG mockup, not a generated photo. Regenerate the real hero with image_gen once the user selects the direction.

